Tins of non-spinach are special.  There are six possible types of tin,
chosen when you open the tin.  A cursed tin is always "rotten".  A tin
that you make with a tinning kit is always "homemade".  All other tins
are random.  The type of monster determines side-effects but doesn't
affect tin nutrition.
 500/10 =  50	pureed
  60/10 =   6	deep fried
  50/10 =   5	homemade
  40/10 =   4	pickled
  20/10 =   2	soup
 -50/10 =  -5	rotten
The expected nutrition for random tins is
 103/10 =  10.3

